X:1
T:Aamar Sonaar Baangla
C:Rabindranath Tagore
S:notes: data/raw_data/midi/rs000223.mid (Geetabitan, arranged by Anjan Ganguly), violin track
S:lyrics: data/raw_data/text/lyrics/rs000223.txt (Geetabitan transliteration)
S:alignment: data/raw_data/swaralipi/rs000223.pdf (Geetabitan swaralipi; SNLTR has no swaralipi for this song)
N:Notes quantized to 16ths (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks). Sa = C; komal Ni (A#) and Ni (B) both occur.
N:Form played by the MIDI: sthayi (Aamar sonaar baangla twice, Chirodin); five verses on the tune of O maa phaagune, each followed by the return to sonaar baangla, with the interludes Ki shobha, Tomar ei khelaghare, Dhenu-chora and O maa tor charonete between them; the sthayi's first line to end.
N:Syllables placed by hand from the Geetabitan swaralipi PDF; where the MIDI has a bar the swaralipi lacks (bar 320) it holds.
N:Syllables placed on the notes as in the swaralipi; one swaralipi matra = one quarter note.
